    <!-- ================================================================
         Live-reactive controller visualization (rendering swap).
         Draws an Xbox-style controller outline (2 px BrushOutlineVariant)
         and highlights the element matching Model.XInputType with a
         BrushPrimary fill whose opacity follows Model.Highlight (the
         wizard's 500 ms blink): 0.9 while blinking on, 0.35 while off,
         0 (outline only) when the element is not the active input.
         Same XInputType / Highlight model as the previous static artwork.
         ================================================================ -->
